            "review_text": "sanjay bagadia\nAhmedabad, India179 contributions\n1\nOnly Indian vegetarian restaurant in grand world\nApr 2025 • Couples\nThis is the only Indian vegetarian restaurant in grand world, phu quoc island.\nFood is good and made fresh on order.\nSelf service only\nOrder at counter and collect your food, no table service.\nPeople are not really friendly as success has made them invincible.\nHowever this is a great place for Indian vegetarians as they can enjoy pure veg north indian food on this remote island too.\nTotal peace of mind & no need hunting or experimenting for good food. \nVisit early by 7pm else it gets crowded and nearly impossible to get a table easily.\nUsually the food is less spicy so instruct them accordingly to prepare your food.\nThey have branches in vinwonder and city area too.\nRead more\nWritten April 26, 2025",
